	-- Measured in this tooltip's own font, before a figure is built (`UI:MoneyFontFrom`).
	UI:MoneyFontFrom(tooltip)
--- new
	-- Measured in this tooltip's own font, before a figure is built (`UI:MoneyFontFrom`).
